UID:Cvin5W2uD5
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 128 mins (2h08m)\n\nSet at the height of the great p
 urge and drenched in the paranoia of Stalin’s police state\, Ukranian fi
 lmmaker Sergei Loznitsa’s latest triumph is a chilling\, Kafkaesque thri
 ller about the impunity of power and matter-of-fact horrors of fascism.\n\
 nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/two-prosecutors\n\nEstimated star
 t: 16:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
